    "body": "claimed: main session (review fixes for PR #83, queued behind three running fix agents) · 2026-11-07T13:42Z · branch issue/79-radial-rapid-check · plan: the independent review found (1) performance - ~3,150 sample points per mm of rapid, a full-edge Region::contains per point, an oldest-first quadratic scan of earlier cut cylinders rebuilt per rapid (~1e9 ops for 40 pecked holes) - pre-filter by swept bbox, scan newest first, stock bbox reject, drop duplicate samples; (2) the only app-level test goes vacuous once #82 lands - add a deterministic fixture; sim tests for past-the-bottom, tangential graze, half-in-hole retract; (3) fails open on NaN stock top / zero flute / degenerate axis - refuse by name; doc says 0.5 mm body step but it is 1.0.",
